      "skill_change": "Implement query-conditioned retrieval with re-ranking",
      "concrete_action": "Augment retrieval with a two-stage pipeline: (1) dense retrieval to fetch top-k candidates, then (2) cross-encoder re-ranker conditioned on question + candidate to score relevance — prioritizing candidates containing temporal phrases, named entities, or predicate-argument structures matching the question."
    },
    {
      "skill_change": "Enrich memories with structured fact extraction and temporal grounding",
      "concrete_action": "During memory storage, run lightweight NLP pipelines to extract and attach: (a) normalized dates (resolve 'yesterday' → ISO date using session timestamp), (b) subject-predicate-object triples (e.g., [Jon, lost_job, banker], [John, practices, kickboxing]), and (c) speaker-identity tags; store both raw text and structured annotations."
    }
  ]
